# The Divorce

[[id: q1]]

[[goal: divorce | id: divorce | subject: WIFE | object: HUSBAND]]

[[goal: protect | id: reputation | subject: HUSBAND | object: his reputation]]

EXT. DRIVEWAY - DAY

[[beat: She has come to say it | ahead: WIFE]]

The WIFE gets out of her car. The HUSBAND, watering the lawn, sees her face and knows what is coming.

WIFE
We need to talk.

[[beat: He shuts her out | ahead: HUSBAND]]

He drops the hose and runs for the front door.

INT. HOUSE - HALL - CONTINUOUS

He slams the door and locks it. Takes the stairs two at a time.

INT. HOUSE - BEDROOM - CONTINUOUS

He locks this door too. Sits on the bed, breathing hard, listening.
